    "text": "Butan tweon, lar is haligdomes d\u00e6l, & ealles swi\u00f0ost gif hio hyre gymeleste fram adrife\u00f0 & \u00e6lce\nSo\u00f0lice sio lar mid geswince hio sceal \u00fea forenemnedan \u00feing for\u00f0bringan.\nWitodlice ealle Cristes \u00fea gecorenan \u00feurh geswinc & \u00feurh lare hie wurdon geweor\u00f0ode \u00fee we nu\n\u00deara w\u00e6s Abel on fyrm\u00fee middangeardes & o\u00f0er Noe.\nNe m\u00e6g se rihtwisa man bion butan geswince gemang \u00feam unrihtwisan.\nWitodlice Noe ana w\u00e6s rihtwis betweox eall manna cyn, & he for his rihtwisnesse Gode licode.\nOngita\u00f0 nu hw\u00e6t ic eow secge: gif ge nu bio\u00f0 geswencte, \u00fee swa manigra haligra manna m\u00e6genu to\nGe\u00feenca\u00f0 nu hwylca \u00fea wyrda w\u00e6ron \u00e6r \u00f0am flode, & hwylce Abrahames forl\u00e6tu w\u00e6ron, & hu he his\nGemuna\u00f0 eac hwylce ehtnesse Isac \u00e6ghwanon r\u00e6fnode, & hu he hyra \u00feeawe \u00feeowode & o\u00f0re men to\nGemuna\u00f0 eac Iacobes m\u00e6nigfealdan geswinc.\nBe \u00f0am geswincum he w\u00e6s sprecende to Faraone & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Lytle syndon mine dagas & awyrgede.\nNe becomon hy na to minra f\u00e6dera dagum.\nGe\u00feencea\u00f0 eac Iosep & Moyses & iesunaue & Dauid & Eliam & Samuel & ealle \u00f0a halegan witegan,\nHw\u00e6t, wene ge \u00fe\u00e6t ge m\u00e6gen \u00feurh idelnesse becuman to \u00f0\u00e6re biorhtnesse \u00fee Godes \u00fea gecorenan mid\nButan twion ge magon gif ge willa\u00f0.\nIc eow secge be \u00f0am apostolum, ealle hie w\u00e6ron geswencte maran geswincum \u00feonne \u00e6nige o\u00f0re men.\n\u00d0a him eac Crist sylf fores\u00e6de: On \u00feyssum middangearde ge habba\u00f0 geswinc, & eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ge\nNeara & wi\u00f0erdene is se halega weg, swa swa dryhten sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0.\nWitodlice is se weg neara \u00fee to life gel\u00e6de\u00f0.\n\u00dea \u00f0a \u00fea ruman wegas swi\u00f0e dysiglice hie do\u00f0, ne becuma\u00f0 hie na to life, ac he hie gel\u00e6de\u00f0 to\nGemuna\u00f0 eac \u00fea \u00f0e eall hira lif on \u00feisse worulde on olehtungum lifedon.\nGe\u00feencea\u00f0 \u00feonne Ladzarus & \u00feone welegan \u00fee her d\u00e6ghwamlice symlede & is \u00f0\u00e6r nu singallice\nAnd gemuna\u00f0 Iudeas \u00fee hira lif eall hyra wambe to forlore forgeafon.\nBe \u00f0am w\u00e6s cweden \u00fe\u00e6t hyra wamb w\u00e6re hyra god.\nGe\u00feencea\u00f0 eac \u00feara \u00fee in Sodome for hira unalyfedum gewilnungum forwurdon, & \u00feara \u00fee on Noes\nWitodlice be \u00f0am \u00fee \u00f0am y\u00f0an life lyfedon on Sodome hit w\u00e6s gecweden \u00f0\u00e6tte on hlafes fylnesse\n\u00deonne sio fylnes \u00f0\u00e6s hlafes unriht wyrce\u00f0, hw\u00e6t is to cwe\u00f0anne be \u00f0am m\u00e6nigfealdum smeamettum?\nGemuna\u00f0 hu Esaw his dagas on ehtnesse l\u00e6dde, & hu \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00e6r in \u00feam ryne Godes bearn w\u00e6ron \u00feurh\nGemuna\u00fe eac hu \u00fea forwurdon \u00fee mid wodheortnesse willan to w\u00e6pnedmannum h\u00e6med sohton, &\nEac swylce \u00fea ilcan witu syndon gearuwe \u00feam mannum \u00fee nu swylcum lifum lifia\u00f0 swylce hie lyfedon.\nGehyra\u00f0 eac hw\u00e6t Crist cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea \u00fee mid hnescum hr\u00e6glum gegyrede w\u00e6ron, on cyinga husum\nOn heofenum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0onne is \u00fea \u00fee for Godes lufan swylce habban nella\u00f0.\nWitodlice \u00e6g\u00f0er ge hnesce hr\u00e6gl ge gehwylce hnescnesse \u00feysse worulde no \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fea unf\u00e6str\u00e6dan ac\nFor hwon wene ge \u00fe\u00e6t wif swa sioce syn of hyra gecynde?\nAc hit is swa: of hira li\u00f0an life hie bio\u00f0 swa tyddre, for \u00fean \u00fee hie symle inne bio\u00f0 & noht hefies ne\nEac \u00f0u meaht \u00fee bet ongytan \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee so\u00f0 secge gif \u00f0u genimst on hwylcum orcearde & on windigre\n\u00d0onne meaht \u00f0u gesion \u00fe\u00e6t hit sona forleose\u00f0 \u00fea f\u00e6gernesse \u00fee hit h\u00e6fde on his agenre stowe.\n\u00deenc eac be \u00f0am wifum \u00fee cyrliscu wiorc & hefegu on symbel wyrcea\u00fe.\n\u00deonne cnawest \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6t hie bio\u00f0 halran & cafran \u00feonne \u00fea weras \u00fee on idelnesse lifia\u00f0.\nNu sio idelnes swa swi\u00f0e \u00feam lichoman dere\u00f0, ne tweoge \u00fee na \u00fe\u00e6t hio \u00fe\u00e6re sawle ne sce\u00f0\u00f0e, for \u00fean\nFor \u00f0on ic halsie \u00fe\u00e6t we urne lichoman & sawle mid geswincum gestrangien, nal\u00e6s mid idelnessum\nNe sprece ic \u00feas word to eowrum anum ac to wifum.\nEawla, wif, to hwan wenest \u00f0u \u00feines lichoman h\u00e6le geican mid smyringe & oft\u00feweale & o\u00f0rum\nOf \u00f0am cyme\u00f0 unh\u00e6lo, nals m\u00e6gen.\nGif \u00f0u \u00fea ilcan olectunge \u00feam lichoman dest, \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman hiw f\u00e6gere bi\u00f0 \u00feonne hit \u00e6r w\u00e6s.\nGif \u00f0u \u00feonne his lustum symle fulg\u00e6st, \u00feonne ne m\u00e6g he naw\u00f0er ne his m\u00e6gen ne his f\u00e6gernysse\nHw\u00e6t, ge witon \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6lc hus bi\u00f0 \u00fee f\u00e6gere \u00fee hit man hwita\u00f0.\nSwa eac bi\u00f0 \u00e6lc lichoma \u00f0e f\u00e6gerra \u00fee hine \u00fe\u00e6re sawle scima gebyrhtet.\nSona se lichoma sceal bion unf\u00e6ger, \u00feonne he mid unrotnesse & mid sare aseted bi\u00f0, \u00f0a cuma\u00f0 of \u00f0am\nFor \u00f0an ic l\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t we flion \u00fea li\u00f0nesse & flion \u00fea olehtunge \u00feysse worulde, ac hie synt swi\u00f0e swete.\nSume men synt \u00f0e him \u00feync\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t naw\u00f0er ne \u00e6t ne drync ne genihtsumige, \u00e6r he o\u00f0 \u00f0a hracan ful sie,\n\u00deonne ne don we swa, ac hlysten we \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles lare, Paulus; he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Ne do ge \u00fe\u00e6s fl\u00e6sces giman\nWyrse is \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00f0\u00e6s ofer riht bruce \u00feonne hine mon on feltungrepe wiorpe.\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re grepe he wior\u00f0e\u00f0 to meoxe.\nButan tweon, \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman scea\u00f0a on \u00fe\u00e6re wambe he wior\u00f0e\u00f0 to \u00feam ilcan, and eac \u00f0am lichon to\nEal \u00fe\u00e6t man ofer riht \u00feyge\u00f0 mid uny\u00f0nesse, hit him mon sceal fram adon.\nAc \u00feysses nu feawa gyma\u00fe.\nForneah ealra manna mod sint on oferflowende willan onwended.\nFeda\u00f0 iowre lichoman on riht & forl\u00e6ta\u00f0 \u00fea oferfylle.\nNe sceal man swi\u00f0or etan \u00feonne se maga gemyltan m\u00e6ge.\nSe goda mete \u00e6g\u00f0er de\u00f0, ge \u00feone lichoman fede\u00f0 ge \u00fe\u00e6t mod glada\u00f0 to \u00e6lcere h\u00e6lo, & \u00e6lce\nHelpe\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t se mete hre\u00f0e & wel mylte\u00f0 \u00fee se maga \u00f0yge\u00f0.\n& of \u00f0\u00e6re & oferfylle cuma\u00fe manige mettrymnessa.\nNis sio oferfyll \u00feon betere \u00fee se hunger.\nWe flio\u00f0 \u00feone hunger & lufia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t no betere nis, \u00f0a oferfylle.\nSe hunger \u00feone lichoman sona acwelle\u00f0 & alyse\u00f0 of \u00f0am witelican life.\nSio oferfyll \u00feone lichoman untrumnessa fylle\u00f0 & gede\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he afula\u00f0 & hine \u00feonne \u00e6t nyxstan mid\nNe l\u00e6re ic \u00fe\u00e6t men hy hungre acwellan, ac \u00f0\u00e6t hy swa mycles brucen swa him \u00e6g\u00f0er ge to h\u00e6le ge to\nWitodlice ne m\u00e6g sio oferfyl n\u00e6nig\u00feinga to \u00fe\u00e6re sawle \u00fewerian, ac hio \u00fe\u00e6re sawle & \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman\nAc \u00feeah \u00f0e hwa eallra manna wisost sie, gif he his luste fulg\u00e6\u00f0, he hine geny\u00f0era\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00f0urh\nWitodlice ne m\u00e6g sio hungriende wamb \u00e6nne unrihtlust acennan ne sio gemetegode fyl \u00feon ma.\nAc of \u00fe\u00e6re oferfylle cuma\u00f0 \u00fea unrihtan lustas gelice & on meresteallum wyrmas tyddria\u00f0, & of \u00f0\u00e6re\nFor \u00fean ic l\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t we urne lichoman mid oferfylle ne gewemmen, ac mid gemetegunge",
